SubsuperscriptBox[\\\"\[CapitalPhi]\\\", \\\"LL\\\", \\\"SF\\\"], \\\"\
\[RightAngleBracket]\\\"}]\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
      FontSize->9], 
