LL},p}$, and the covariant derivative of a field that transforms like \
$\\\\Psi^*_{\\\\rm LL}$ (the hole component), $\\\\nabla^{{\\\\rm \
LL}*}_p=\\\\partial_p+(\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm LL}_p)^*+i\\\\,(\\\\mathsf \
