\\sum_p\\\\gamma^p_{\\\\rm LL}\\\\nabla^{\\\\rm LL}_p=\\\\begin{pmatrix}0&M_{\
\\\\rm LL}(\\\\mathbf D_{\\\\rm LL})\\\\\\\\M_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\bar{\\\\mathbf \
