  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67296a78-38a4-491a-9ff4-942cf24e21a1"],
 ", in which the 27 components of the symbol ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
