                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "4ad943f5-e396-4945-822a-cda32d1b016f"],
               
               " replaces every complex coefficient by its complex conjugate; \
",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 RowBox[{
                  SuperscriptBox[
                   StyleBox["x",
                    FontWeight->"Bold",
                    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Dagger]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
