                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "f2254e05-9e25-4ead-8651-7daf9939ccf5"],
               " (complex-valued; for bi-quaternions the determinant of the ",
               
               Cell[BoxData[
