                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "35607e49-1fa4-47f4-b911-3b4271e45c98"],
               
               " of bi-octonions (the same brackets of other elements are \
defined at their place: the bracket of an algebra ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalF]",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
