                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "327330b3-e005-4b11-8caa-bdc636f13cda"],
               "), a subgroup of ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalL]",
