                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "e05e1929-00b6-4b54-b9fb-fc5627877886"],
               " Dirac matrices of ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalR]",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
