               ": the exponential, natural logarithm, square root, a sum, an \
integral, the set of real linear combinations, a dimension"
              }], "Text",
               FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
               FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
               "84112cb5-1c8e-4931-a0fa-1515a8fe11fb"],
              ImageSize->290]},
            {
             PaneBox[
              TemplateBox[{
                SuperscriptBox["", "T"], "\", \"", "\[CircleTimes]", "\", \"",
                 "\[CirclePlus]", "\", \"", "\[SmallCircle]", "\", \"", 
                RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", "\[RightAngleBracket]"}]},
               "RowDefault"],
              ImageSize->125], 
             PaneBox[
              StyleBox["\<\"(x) ^T o\"\>",
               StripOnInput->False,
               FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
               FontSize->8],
              ImageSize->95], 
             PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
               "transpose; tensor product and direct sum (plain text ",
               StyleBox["(x)",
                FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
               " for ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox["\[CircleTimes]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "01750831-7686-4fbf-99be-d8bab33d3f85"],
               
               "); composition of maps; expectation value in the ground \
state; the Hermitian conjugate of the preceding terms"
              }], "Text",
               FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
               FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
               "562ed296-817e-49e5-b312-6d70f5a15ef0"],
              ImageSize->290]},
            {
             PaneBox[
              
              StyleBox["\<\"A-1, ..., R-6; G-1, ..., G-12; LL-S1, ..., LL-H1; \
X-1, ..., X-10; Z-1, ..., Z-8; Theorems R, L, M, SF1, ..., SF4\"\>",
               StripOnInput->False,
               FontSize->9],
              ImageSize->125], 
             PaneBox[
              StyleBox["\<\"\"\>",
               StripOnInput->False,
               FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
               FontSize->8],
              ImageSize->95], 
             PaneBox[Cell["\<\
the identifiers of the machine checks of the project (letters: A \
associativity, L Lorentz super-loop, Q operators and eigenvalues, C the \
inversion element, M Malcev classification, G Groebner bases, N manifolds, S \
superfluid, R renormalizability, LL-S symbols, LL-H self-containedness, X the \
examples of the spin-zero superfluid, Z the 3+1 manifold and the \
renormalizability of the Yukawa form) and the labels of the theorems of the \
project; they are names, not mathematical symbols\
\>", "Text",
               FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
               FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
               "35b28697-ba3a-4269-982d-b7810348af9f"],
              ImageSize->290]},
            {
             PaneBox[
              StyleBox["\<\"H-grp, H-op, H-Lie, H-gr, H-dyn\"\>",
               StripOnInput->False,
               FontSize->9],
              ImageSize->125], 
             PaneBox[
              StyleBox["\<\"\"\>",
               StripOnInput->False,
               FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
               FontSize->8],
              ImageSize->95], 
             PaneBox[Cell["\<\
the labels of the hypotheses of the no-go theorems: the symmetries form a \
group (H-grp), act as linear operators on the space of states (H-op), have \
generators that form a Lie algebra (H-Lie) or a Lie superalgebra (H-gr), and \
the dynamical hypotheses on the scattering matrix (H-dyn)\
\>", "Text",
               FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
               FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
               "27da1142-04a4-4523-bf58-81f34b396c0c"],
              ImageSize->290]}
           },
           AutoDelete->False,
