            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "84a3ebab-400a-4447-bee1-5060f1c36fca"],
           " act as the phases times ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              StyleBox["SO", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "ebc4661f-19f6-4e7b-aeea-4ff7ffae6645"],
           "), and the group of the rotations and reflections of a plane"
