  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "42bdeb5f-bb41-4aae-99ba-99f813f55f2b"],
 " of the isospin vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
      StyleBox["j", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
