Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
II.1.5 The time integration (t2core/src/cvode.rs): IDA of SUNDIALS through \
NDSolve\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"450e3098-706b-4b14-8df4-27a5360f8b81"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The equations and the integrator. The lattice equations of a Nambu mode are \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["lat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["lat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["lat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c63f71d-50c1-43af-8b94-bb0e219adfee"],
 ": the mode is written as one complex vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["lat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "662ef08f-727b-4ab2-a670-02f0ab60582c"],
 " (the 16 components of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Psi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["p",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b7e220bf-dd7f-4142-9d64-a74579365fa2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Psi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["h",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a52a562d-2491-42b8-90ee-dccaa77ec728"],
 " on every site, the sites one after the other) with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["cpx",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "41d313f4-dc6b-4af8-b668-2b2456943e32"],
 " complex components ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["cmp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ac38a44-d042-448f-aebe-618b8a731b82"],
 ". The original programs integrate them in time with CVODE, the solver of \
ordinary differential equations of the suite SUNDIALS (SUite of Nonlinear and \
DIfferential/ALgebraic equation Solvers, Lawrence Livermore National \
Laboratory; version 7.8.0 rewritten in Rust and called through the module \
cvode.rs of t2core), with the Adams-Moulton formulas of the orders 1 to 12. \
The first version of the original programs, and of this notebook, used the \
classical Runge-Kutta method of the fourth order with a fixed step, written \
by hand; such a method is used nowhere in the project any more. A notebook \
cannot call the Rust program. The Wolfram Language contains another \
integrator of the same suite: IDA, the solver of differential-algebraic \
equations, which ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " uses with the option ",
 StyleBox["Method -> \"IDA\"",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". An ordinary differential equation is the special case without algebraic \
equations. Part II uses IDA for every time integration."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c9a224d9-fa11-4ae7-bf75-ac91ddfd204f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "How IDA integrates, and what its tolerances mean. IDA advances the solution \
in internal steps with the backward differentiation formulas of the orders 1 \
to 5 (such a formula expresses the derivative at the end of a step by the \
values at the ends of this step and of the steps before it) and solves the \
equations of every step by Newton's method. It chooses the length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["IDA",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14aa3232-7ca4-4dba-a4bf-dc11ce72224a"],
 " and the order of every step itself, so that an estimate of the local \
error, the error made in this one step, passes a test: the weighted \
root-mean-square norm of the estimate must be at most 1. This norm is the \
square root of the mean, over all real unknowns, of the squares of the \
estimated errors, each divided by the tolerance of its unknown; the tolerance \
of a real unknown is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6661b1e2-ff07-4fe4-9eff-c8e30a5bdbe5"],
 " times the modulus of the unknown plus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a45fbd7c-6f61-4161-a2a0-f8d27d40a169"],
 ", with the relative tolerance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "59e1682b-12a3-4e8f-9ae3-c9fc32ba2b32"],
 " and the absolute tolerance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "502d9daf-3c0d-498c-a653-ea8bb201d926"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " takes the two tolerances from its options: the relative tolerance is 10 to \
the power minus the setting of ",
 StyleBox["PrecisionGoal",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", the absolute tolerance 10 to the power minus the setting of ",
 StyleBox["AccuracyGoal",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " therefore sets these options to the negative decimal logarithms of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3a240f5e-cacd-4bc9-b7d5-6ba6e21b44a4"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1708f784-f1f9-4260-9fb4-4997f02b9878"],
 ". After a successful step IDA doubles the length of the step if its \
estimate allows that; otherwise it keeps the length or shortens it. If the \
error of every real unknown equals its tolerance, the norm of the error of \
one step is the norm of the vector of the tolerances, which by the triangle \
inequality is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ddb2849-6336-4c23-935a-a8628a6846bb"],
 " times the norm of the state plus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9ff3f751-dade-407e-a912-6621af3852db"],
 " times the square root of the number ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["cpx",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60269dfa-ee20-4f15-8d64-6f9cc128ea48"],
 " of real unknowns. This number is called ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "18e77c99-e17a-44a0-83ed-34bf9c4edc00"],
 ". The exact local error of a step, called ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c094be8-fa83-46de-9d80-dbaccde90bb0"],
 ", is the norm of the difference between the computed state at the end of \
the step and the exact solution that starts from the computed state at its \
beginning. IDA tests its estimate, not ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a3ae558b-d765-4a6d-9ad0-d8e3328f83d1"],
 " itself, so the checks T2-IDA and GS-13 measure ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46a7fc59-4fbb-4139-9b72-552425ccf965"],
 " for every internal step and compare it with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69728419-acbd-4c84-a025-59115c407f77"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3ca4a3fe-e8f9-4986-bbaa-fb9b632b2596"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The real form. IDA computes with real numbers (",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " answers a complex equation for this method with the message \
NDSolveValue::mconly and gives no solution). ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " therefore writes the state as the real vector of the length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["cpx",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b51770f2-2c0c-4671-b15d-912d19166c82"],
 " made of the real parts ",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and the imaginary parts ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of its components, and the Hermitian matrix as ",
 StyleBox["hr",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " + ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02711788-90b3-40b4-89f7-db75269e6b07"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["hi",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " with the real symmetric matrix ",
 StyleBox["hr",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and the real antisymmetric matrix ",
 StyleBox["hi",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["lat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["lat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d48ef43-0f5b-455b-950e-a562a7c3bad6"],
 " has the real part ",
 StyleBox["hi.u + hr.v",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and the imaginary part ",
 StyleBox["-hr.u + hi.v",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", so the lattice equations are the real linear system with the matrix ",
 StyleBox["m = {{hi, hr}, {-hr, hi}}",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " acting on the real vector (",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "). The matrix ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is antisymmetric, and the largest length that it gives to a vector of the \
length 1 is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["max",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "344846f9-59a6-4765-bec1-192233434bc2"],
 ", the largest modulus of the eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["qp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "18b0b844-b652-4473-9917-5910c07a95b5"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["lat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "508313b5-4c1c-46a0-a4cc-e915f82c5652"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57455456-4fa8-4b2a-abc3-36115c37f445"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The states between the internal steps. ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " returns the solution as an ",
 StyleBox["InterpolatingFunction",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Its grid is the list of the times at the ends of the internal steps; with \
every grid time it stores the value of the solution and the value of the \
derivative that IDA computed there, and between two neighbouring grid times \
it gives every real unknown by the polynomial of the third degree that has \
these values and derivatives at the two ends (cubic Hermite interpolation). \
An output time lies in general inside an internal step, so a state returned \
by ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is an interpolated one, and its deviation from the exact solution has \
three sources. (1) The deviations of the stored values at the two ends of the \
step from the exact solution. The polynomial weighs the two values with \
numbers between 0 and 1 whose sum is 1, and the two derivatives with numbers \
whose moduli add up to at most one quarter of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["IDA",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36bc1100-77ad-4cf5-896e-a1dc8703c2f6"],
 "; the exact derivative is ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " applied to the exact value. If the larger deviation at the two ends is at \
most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["err",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c9f495d9-92d9-4ba7-8c46-68a8611fbba1"],
 ", this source gives at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      FractionBox["1", "4"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["IDA",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["max",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["err",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e7dd4677-d675-4e46-8879-0d0045191014"],
 ". (2) The stored derivatives are not exactly ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " applied to the stored values, because Newton's method stops at a \
tolerance. The norm of the difference at a grid time is called ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["der",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "96b395c9-9dda-4a49-9ef8-b91da13bd914"],
 "; it gives at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "4"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["IDA",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["der",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e871ff71-8cb9-4b7b-8333-21321ff4da58"],
 ". (3) The interpolation of the exact solution itself. The cubic Hermite \
polynomial of a function with a continuous fourth derivative deviates from \
the function, at a time inside the step, by an average of the fourth \
derivative over the step, taken with a weight that is nowhere negative and \
whose integral is the product of the squares of the distances of that time \
from the two ends, divided by 24. The product is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["IDA",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "4"], "/", "16"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f89e00cb-2729-4f06-9fbd-9bf0ee8fe7ff"],
 ", and the fourth derivative of the exact solution is the fourth power of ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " applied to it, a vector of at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["max",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07738230-565f-418a-b4ca-5a80245c8cf3"],
 " times the norm of the state. This source therefore gives at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox["IDA",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox["max",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "4"], "/", "384"}], TraditionalForm]],
   "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c8205e9c-db41-4887-a762-b5c2d58af620"],
 " times the norm of the state. The sum of the three is the bound ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["out",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f883dabf-6699-4e49-bdfa-9f1dffaf6276"],
 " of the deviation of a returned state, written here for a state of the norm \
1:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7438aa81-0f3b-49e4-a777-8afbfabee5f2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["out",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"1", "+", 
     FractionBox["1", "4"], 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["IDA",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["max",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["err",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
   FractionBox["1", "4"], 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["IDA",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["der",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox["IDA",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox["max",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "4"], "384"]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"03d98136-1956-4c02-992a-c33b646ab102"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The deviation at the ends of the steps. The exact evolution is unitary: it \
changes the norm of no vector. The deviation at the end of a step is \
therefore the deviation at its beginning, carried along unchanged in size, \
plus the local error of the step, so that the deviation after ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["st",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "90e316ef-6964-409e-a993-9abcaa9bef10"],
 " steps is at most the sum of their local errors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9d577901-8516-48be-aa54-6c791c8c0ea4"],
 ". If every local error is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1055ae75-992e-4292-8624-5a8414d7a338"],
 ", the deviation at the end of every step is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["err",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["st",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["loc",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "78317efd-bc56-4bfc-a49b-d2f479edcf8a"],
 ", the accumulated local error that the tolerances allow. (The original \
programs use the same number with the tolerances of CVODE, which weighs the \
real and the imaginary part of a complex component with the modulus of the \
component: there ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "436d9791-90b4-4d06-971d-819018f096b6"],
 " is the square root of 2 times the sum of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd97a900-5167-49f4-b506-476ae0ec2a00"],
 " times the norm of the state and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7676dff9-c2aa-4045-8c7b-975f32021f69"],
 " times the square root of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["cpx",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "93003311-83df-41a2-8cbf-488c219b4b98"],
 ".) The function ",
 StyleBox["t2localErrorsIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " measures ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e58e296e-4799-493e-94ab-cb79e1620113"],
 " for every internal step: with the eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["qp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7414e745-3a25-4b52-a9bf-de68a2cc4e22"],
 " and the eigenvectors of the Hermitian matrix, the exact solution that \
starts from a computed state multiplies the coefficient of the eigenvector \
number ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7717aef4-5add-42b1-814b-a490bede8b86"],
 " by the phase factor of the angle ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
       StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
      StyleBox["qp",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["IDA",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "aa23fdba-b8fc-4355-82e9-e7a21aece700"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"107d3303-08c0-40e3-90a6-5d676be7f70c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"The", " ", "time", " ", "integration", " ", "of", " ", "i", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dw", "/", "dx0"}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"hm", " ", ".", " ", "w"}], " ", "by", " ", "IDA", " ", "of", " ",
        "SUNDIALS", " ", "through", " ", 
       RowBox[{"NDSolve", ".", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"hm", ":", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "a", " ", "Hermitian", " ", "matrix", " ", "that", " ", "does", " ", 
          "not", " ", "depend", " ", "on", " ", "the", " ", "time"}]}]}]}]}], 
     ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"w0", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"the", " ", "state", " ", "at", " ", "x0"}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
      "0"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"touts", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "output", " ", "times", " ", "in", "\n", "   ", 
       "increasing", " ", "order"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "first", " ", "of", " ", "them", " ", "0"}], ";", 
     " ", "rtol"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"atol", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "tolerances", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "local", " ", 
       "error", " ", "test"}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"analysis", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "optionally", " ", "a", "\n", "   ", "function", " ", "that", " ", "is",
        " ", "applied", " ", "to", " ", "the", " ", "InterpolatingFunction", " ",
        "of", " ", "the", " ", "real", " ", "form", " ", "before", " ", "it", 
       " ", "is", " ", 
       RowBox[{"discarded", ".", "\n", "   ", "The"}], " ", "result", " ", 
       "is", " ", "an", " ", "association", " ", "with", " ", "the", " ", 
       "keys", "\n", "     ", "\"\<states\>\"", "       ", "the", " ", 
       "complex", " ", "states", " ", "at", " ", "the", " ", "output", " ", 
       "times", "\n", "     ", "\"\<steps\>\"", "        ", "the", " ", 
       "number", " ", 
       RowBox[{"N", "^", "st"}], " ", "of", " ", "internal", " ", "steps", "\n",
        "     ", "\"\<evaluations\>\"", "  ", "the", " ", "number", " ", 
       RowBox[{"N", "^", "ev"}], " ", "of", " ", "evaluations", " ", "of", " ",
        "the", " ", "right", " ", "side", " ", 
       RowBox[{"m", " ", ".", " ", "y"}], " ", "that", " ", "NDSolve", " ", 
       "reports", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", "EvaluationMonitor", ")"}], "\n", "     ", "\"\<hmax\>\"",
        "         ", "the", " ", "largest", " ", "internal", " ", "step", " ", 
       RowBox[{"h", "^", "IDA"}], "\n", "     ", "\"\<stepAt\>\"", "       ", 
       "for", " ", "every", " ", "output", " ", "time", " ", "after", " ", 
       "the", " ", "first"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "length", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "internal", " ", 
       "step", " ", "that", " ", "contains", " ", "it", "\n", 
       "     ", "\"\<residualAt\>\"", "   ", "for", " ", "the", " ", "same", " ",
        "output", " ", 
       RowBox[{"times", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"the", " ", "larger", " ", "norm", " ", 
          RowBox[{"r", "^", "der"}], " ", "of", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"stored", " ", "derivative"}], ")"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"m", " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"stored", " ", "value"}], ")"}]}], " ", "at", "\n", 
          "                    ", "the", " ", "two", " ", "ends", " ", "of", " ",
           "that", " ", "step", "\n", "     ", "\"\<hermiteAt\>\"", "    ", 
          "for", " ", "the", " ", "same", " ", "output", " ", "times"}]}], ":",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "the", " ", "norm", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "difference", " ", 
         "between", " ", "the", " ", "state", " ", "given", " ", "by", " ", 
         "NDSolve", " ", "and", " ", "the", "\n", "                    ", 
         "cubic", " ", "Hermite", " ", "polynomial", " ", "built", " ", 
         "here", " ", "from", " ", "the", " ", "values", " ", "and", " ", 
         "the", " ", "derivatives", " ", "at", " ", "the", " ", "two", " ", 
         "ends", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "step", "\n", 
         "     ", "\"\<analysis\>\"", "     ", "the", " ", "result", " ", 
         "of", " ", "the", " ", "function", " ", "analysis"}]}]}]}]}], ",", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"or", " ", 
     RowBox[{"None", ".", "\n", "   ", "A"}], " ", "failed", " ", 
     "integration", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
      "NDSolve", " ", "then", " ", "prints", " ", "a", " ", "message"}], 
      ")"}], " ", "gives", " ", 
     RowBox[{"$Failed", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2evolveIDA", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"hm_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"w0_", "?", "VectorQ"}], ",", " ", "touts_List", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rtol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"atol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"analysis_", " ", ":", " ", "None"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n",
      "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"nc", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "w0", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "m", ",", " ", 
         "yIDA", ",", " ", "tIDA", ",", " ", "sol", ",", " ", "dsol", ",", 
         " ", "grid", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"nev", " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "ends", ",", " ", 
         "toComplex", ",", " ", "hermite"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Developer`ToPackedArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", 
           RowBox[{"ArrayFlatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Im", "[", "hm", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Re", "[", "hm", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", 
                 RowBox[{"Re", "[", "hm", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Im", "[", "hm", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], 
           "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"yIDA", "'"}], "[", "tIDA", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
              RowBox[{"m", " ", ".", " ", 
               RowBox[{"yIDA", "[", "tIDA", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"yIDA", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
              RowBox[{"N", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Re", "[", "w0", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Im", "[", "w0", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
            " ", "yIDA", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"tIDA", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Max", "[", "touts", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
           
           RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<IDA\>\""}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"PrecisionGoal", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"Log10", "[", "rtol", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"AccuracyGoal", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"Log10", "[", "atol", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"MaxSteps", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"10", "^", "7"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"EvaluationMonitor", " ", ":>", " ", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"nev", "++"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Head", "[", "sol", "]"}], " ", "=!=", " ", 
           "InterpolatingFunction"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
           RowBox[{"$Failed", ",", " ", "Module"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n",
         "   ", 
        RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", "\"\<Grid\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        "   ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Last", "[", "grid", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", "touts", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
           RowBox[{"$Failed", ",", " ", "Module"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n",
         "   ", 
        RowBox[{"dsol", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Derivative", "[", "1", "]"}], "[", "sol", "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"toComplex", "[", "y_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "nc"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          
          RowBox[{"I", " ", 
           RowBox[{"y", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"nc", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], " ", ";;", " ", 
              RowBox[{"2", " ", "nc"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", 
        "   ", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "the", " ", "two", " ", "ends", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
          "internal", " ", "step", " ", "that", " ", "contains", " ", "an", " ",
           "output", " ", "time"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"ends", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"tout", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"With", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"k", " ", "=", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"LengthWhile", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"grid", ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", " ", "<", " ", "tout"}], " ", "&"}]}], "]"}],
                     " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
                " ", 
               RowBox[{"grid", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"k", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "k"}], "}"}], 
                 "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "touts", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "the", " ", "cubic", " ", "Hermite", " ", "polynomial", " ", "of", " ",
            "the", " ", "step", " ", "from", " ", "a", " ", "to", " ", "b", " ",
            "at", " ", "the", " ", "time", " ", "tout"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
           "from", " ", "the", " ", "values", " ", "and", " ", "derivatives", 
            " ", "at", " ", "a", " ", "and", " ", "b"}], ";", "\n", "      ", 
           
           RowBox[{
           "frac", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "fraction", " ", "of", " ", 
            "the", " ", "step", " ", "that", " ", "lies", " ", "before", " ", 
            "tout"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"hermite", "[", 
          RowBox[{"tout_", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"With", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"frac", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"tout", " ", "-", " ", "a"}], ")"}], "/", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"b", " ", "-", " ", "a"}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
            "     ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                RowBox[{"frac", "^", "3"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                RowBox[{"frac", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"sol", "[", "a", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                RowBox[{"frac", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                RowBox[{"frac", "^", "3"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"sol", "[", "b", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"b", " ", "-", " ", "a"}], ")"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"frac", "^", "3"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"frac", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "+", " ", "frac"}], 
                 ")"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"dsol", "[", "a", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"frac", "^", "3"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"frac", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"dsol", "[", "b", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<states\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"toComplex", "[", 
               RowBox[{"sol", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
             "touts"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<steps\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], ",",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<evaluations\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "nev"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<hmax\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Differences", "[", "grid", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<stepAt\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
             "ends"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<residualAt\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
              RowBox[{"ab", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"dsol", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ab", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"m", " ", ".", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ab", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"dsol", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ab", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"m", " ", ".", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ab", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
                "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", "ends"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<hermiteAt\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"sol", "[", "#1", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                RowBox[{"hermite", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#1", ",", " ", "#2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "touts", "]"}], ",", " ", "ends"}], 
              "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<analysis\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"analysis", " ", "===", " ", "None"}], ",", " ", "None", 
             ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"analysis", "[", "sol", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"The", " ", "exact", " ", "local", " ", "errors", " ", 
      RowBox[{"delta", "^", "loc"}], " ", "of", " ", "all", " ", "internal", " ",
       "steps", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", "solution", " ", "of", " ", 
      "t2evolveIDA"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "for", " ", "the", " ", "Hermitian", " ", "matrix", " ", "with", " ", 
       "the", "\n", "   ", "eigenvalues", " ", "ev", " ", "and", " ", "the", " ",
        "eigenvectors", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", "columns", " ", "of", " ",
        "vv", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"as", " ", "t2eigh", " ", "returns", " ", "them"}], ")"}], ".",
         "  ", "The"}], " ", "states", " ", "at", " ", "the", " ", "grid", " ",
        "times", " ", "are", "\n", "   ", "expanded", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ",
        "eigenvectors", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"the", " ", "rows", " ", "of", " ", "coef"}], ")"}]}], ";", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "exact", " ", "solution", " ", "over", " ", "a", " ", 
        "step", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "length", " ", "h", " ", 
        "multiplies", " ", "the", "\n", "   ", "coefficient", " ", "of", " ", 
        "the", " ", "eigenvalue", " ", "E", " ", "by", " ", "exp", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "i"}], " ", "E", " ", "h"}], ")"}], ".", "  ", 
         "The"}], " ", "steps", " ", "are", " ", "treated", " ", "in", " ", 
        "groups", " ", "of", " ", "2000", " ", "to", " ", "save", " ", 
        RowBox[{"memory", ".", "\n", "   ", "The"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"result", ":", " ", 
         RowBox[{"the", " ", "largest", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"delta", "^", "loc"}], "/", 
           RowBox[{"B", "^", "loc"}]}], " ", "with", " ", 
          RowBox[{"B", "^", "loc"}]}]}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"rtol", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"norm", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "state"}], ")"}]}], " ",
         "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"atol", " ", "sqrt", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", "^", "cpx"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "largest", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"delta", "^", "loc"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "and", " ", "the", " ", "largest", " ", "norm", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ",
       "state", " ", "at", " ", "a", " ", "grid", " ", 
      RowBox[{"time", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"t2localErrorsIDA", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ev_List", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"vv_", "?", "MatrixQ"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rtol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"atol_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], "[", "sol_", "]"}], " ", 
     ":=", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
           RowBox[{"sol", "[", "\"\<Grid\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"vals", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", "\"\<ValuesOnGrid\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"nc", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ev", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "npts", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ratio", " ", "=", " ", "0."}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"emax", " ", "=", " ", "0."}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"nmax", " ", "=", " ", "0."}], ",", " ", "idx", ",", " ", 
         "wgrid", ",", " ", "coef", ",", " ", "err", ",", " ", "nrm"}], "}"}],
        ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"npts", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Do", "[", "\n", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"idx", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
             RowBox[{"first", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"first", " ", "+", " ", "2000"}], ",", " ", "npts"}], 
               "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"wgrid", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"vals", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"idx", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "nc"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"I", " ", 
              RowBox[{"vals", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{"idx", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"nc", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], " ", ";;", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"2", " ", "nc"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n",
            "    ", 
           RowBox[{"coef", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"wgrid", " ", ".", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "vv", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"err", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Norm", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "coef", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Most", "[", "coef", "]"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Outer", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"Times", ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Differences", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"grid", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "idx", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "ev"}],
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"nrm", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Norm", ",", " ", "wgrid"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           
           RowBox[{"ratio", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"ratio", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
               RowBox[{"err", "/", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"rtol", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"Most", "[", "nrm", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"atol", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"2.", " ", "nc"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], 
             "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"emax", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"emax", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Max", "[", "err", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           
           RowBox[{"nmax", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"nmax", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Max", "[", "nrm", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"first", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"npts", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "2000"}], "}"}]}],
          "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<largestRatio\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "ratio"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<largestLocalError\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "emax"}], ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<largestNorm\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "nmax"}]}], 
         "|>"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[316]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b3249477-d416-4202-a0eb-180d56f4012c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Check T2-IDA has two parts. Part (a) shows what the two tolerances mean, on \
the equation whose solution is the decaying exponential function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fc292a63-45f1-43d4-a6e4-a5ba885e6c3f"],
 " (the derivative of the unknown is minus the unknown, the initial value is \
1), integrated from 0 to 25 with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "8"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a558ebfd-d8ee-42d0-bbb5-eb4ed0cd3c6d"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c7591c76-50d3-4579-bb19-963737b523a6"],
 ". The solution falls from 1 to about ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "11"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "142a2922-c117-4b07-8f00-fda7e4881437"],
 ". While it is much larger than ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "19ecf2e5-cfda-4c12-abff-593dbdba6ed9"],
 ", the tolerance of a step is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5985e92e-338d-40f5-bc3f-6d1abb57e321"],
 " times the modulus of the solution; when it is much smaller, the tolerance \
is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tol",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0dff3ccd-7e6b-45f2-b5cd-e5629f4f93a0"],
 ". The check requires that the exact local error of every internal step is \
at most the tolerance of the step, and that in each of the two regimes the \
largest ratio of the local error to the tolerance exceeds 1/128. The second \
requirement shows that the tolerances are the stated ones and not smaller \
ones: by its rule for the doubling of a step, IDA at the order 5 doubles the \
step as soon as its estimate falls below 1/128 of the tolerance. Part (b) \
tests ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["t2localErrorsIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " on a Hermitian ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "432e46e7-91f4-42f4-a54c-c7705c0a21c3"],
 " matrix, integrated from 0 to 10 with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "146bb720-33c9-49f2-9fc2-9ec5087572c0"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f16f4e0-1707-4fcf-9587-700f5b3feb19"],
 " and compared at 21 output times with the solution by the matrix \
exponential (",
 StyleBox["MatrixExp",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "): every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b9e35825-4b0c-44be-939c-399c4cbe6136"],
 " is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "146e4ae0-e2eb-4dd7-b85b-78d8d5bcf261"],
 ", the largest deviation at the output times is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["out",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f098deaa-9fab-4763-9f10-e89bc214814a"],
 ", and the states of ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " are the cubic Hermite polynomials of the stored values and derivatives \
(tolerance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "12"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "642180a9-2707-4880-85d4-9391b5ebfac6"],
 ")."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a2f6fd74-d1d9-4025-b9ba-2642d5b6a568"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"T2", "-", 
      RowBox[{"IDA", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", "a", ")"}]}]}], ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "local", " ", "errors", " ", "that", " ", "IDA", " ", 
      "accepts", " ", "on", " ", "the", " ", "decaying", " ", 
      "exponential"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"rtol", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"1", "e"}], "-", "8"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"atol", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"1", "e"}], "-", "10"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"rtolDecay", ",", " ", "atolDecay"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1.*^-8", ",", " ", "1.*^-10"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"solDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"yD", ",", " ", "tD"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"yD", "'"}], "[", "tD", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"yD", "[", "tD", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"yD", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "1."}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", "yD", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"tD", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "25"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<IDA\>\""}], ",", "\n", 
         "     ", 
         RowBox[{"PrecisionGoal", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", 
           RowBox[{"Log10", "[", "rtolDecay", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"AccuracyGoal", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", 
           RowBox[{"Log10", "[", "atolDecay", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"gridDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"solDecay", "[", "\"\<Grid\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"valsDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"solDecay", "[", "\"\<ValuesOnGrid\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "exact", " ", "local", " ", "error", " ", "of", " ", "every",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"step", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "computed", " ", "value", " ", "at", " ", "its", " ", 
        "end", " ", "minus", " ", "the", " ", "exact", " ", "solution", " ", 
        "from", " ", "the", " ", "computed", " ", "value", "\n", "   ", "at", 
        " ", "its", " ", "beginning"}]}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "and", " ", "its", " ", "ratio", " ", "to", " ", "the", " ", 
       "tolerance", " ", "rtol"}], " ", "|", "value", "|", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"+", " ", "atol"}], " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "step"}]}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"localDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "valsDecay", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Most", "[", "valsDecay", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
         RowBox[{"-", 
          RowBox[{"Differences", "[", "gridDecay", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ratioDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"localDecay", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"rtolDecay", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Most", "[", "valsDecay", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        "atolDecay"}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "two", " ", 
       RowBox[{"regimes", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{"the", " ", "solution", " ", "above", " ", "100", " ", 
         RowBox[{"atol", "/", "rtol"}]}]}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "1", " ", "never", " ", "holds", " ", "after", " ", "the", " ", "start",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
        "the", " ", "solution", " ", "is", " ", "at", " ", "most", " ", "1"}],
         ")"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "so", " ", "the", "\n", "   ", "relative", " ", "regime", " ", "is", " ",
        "taken", " ", "as", " ", "the", " ", "solution", " ", "above", " ", 
       "10", " ", 
       RowBox[{"atol", "/", "rtol"}]}], " ", "=", " ", "0.1"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "absolute", " ", "regime", " ", "as", " ", "the", " ", 
       "solution", " ", "below", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"atol", "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"10", " ", "rtol"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "=", " ", "0.001"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"relDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Pick", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratioDecay", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"#", " ", ">", " ", 
            RowBox[{"10", " ", 
             RowBox[{"atolDecay", "/", "rtolDecay"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Most", "[", "valsDecay", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"absDecay", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Pick", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratioDecay", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"#", " ", "<", " ", 
            RowBox[{"atolDecay", "/", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"10", " ", "rtolDecay"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Most", "[", "valsDecay", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
      "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"T2", "-", 
      RowBox[{"IDA", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", "b", ")"}]}]}], ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "t2evolveIDA", " ", "on", " ", "a", " ", "Hermitian", " ", "2", " ", "x",
       " ", "2", " ", "matrix", " ", "against", " ", "the", " ", "matrix", " ",
       "exponential"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"hmTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0.3", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"0.2", " ", "I"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"0.2", " ", "I"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "0.7"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"w0Two", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.6", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"0.8", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"toutsTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
      RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "10.", ",", " ", "0.5"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"evTwo", ",", " ", "vvTwo"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2eigh", "[", "hmTwo", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"rtolTwo", ",", " ", "atolTwo"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1.*^-10", ",", " ", "1.*^-12"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"runTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2evolveIDA", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "hmTwo", ",", " ", "w0Two", ",", " ", "toutsTwo", ",", " ", "rtolTwo", ",",
        " ", "atolTwo", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"t2localErrorsIDA", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "evTwo", ",", " ", "vvTwo", ",", " ", "rtolTwo", ",", " ", 
         "atolTwo"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"devTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
          RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "hmTwo", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", ".", 
            " ", "w0Two"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<states\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          "toutsTwo"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"blocTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"rtolTwo", " ", 
       RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<analysis\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<largestNorm\>\""}], "]"}],
         "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"atolTwo", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
        RowBox[{"2.", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"berrTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<steps\>\"", "]"}], " ", "blocTwo"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"boutTwo", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<hmax\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "evTwo", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "4"}]}]}], ")"}], 
       " ", "berrTwo"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<hmax\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<residualAt\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "/", 
        "4"}]}], " ", "+", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<hmax\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "evTwo", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "^", "4"}], "/",
         "384"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<analysis\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<largestNorm\>\""}], "]"}],
         "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<T2-IDA\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<the integrator IDA of SUNDIALS, used through NDSolve with \
Method -> \\\"IDA\\\": (a) on the decaying exponential (rtol = 1e-8, atol = \
1e-10, x_LL^0 from 0 to 25) the exact local error of every internal step is \
at most the tolerance rtol |value| + atol of the step, and the largest ratio \
of the local error to this tolerance exceeds 1/128 both while the solution is \
above 10 atol/rtol and after it has fallen below atol/(10 rtol): the \
tolerances of IDA are 10^-PrecisionGoal and 10^-AccuracyGoal; (b) on a \
Hermitian 2 x 2 matrix (rtol = 1e-10, atol = 1e-12, 21 output times up to 10) \
every local error is at most budget_step = rtol (norm of the state) + atol \
sqrt(4), the largest deviation from the solution by MatrixExp is at most \
budget_out, and the states of NDSolve are the cubic Hermite polynomials of \
the stored values and derivatives (tolerance 1e-12)\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", "ratioDecay", "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", "1"}], " ", "&&",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"relDecay", " ", ">", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "128"}]}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"absDecay", " ", ">", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "128"}]}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<analysis\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<largestRatio\>\""}], 
         "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", "1"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"devTwo", " ", "<=", " ", "boutTwo"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<hermiteAt\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<", 
       " ", "1*^-12"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<(a) \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "localDecay", "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< steps, largest ratio of a local error to its tolerance \
\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", "ratioDecay", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< (relative regime \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"relDecay", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", "\"\<, absolute regime \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"absDecay", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\<); (b) \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<steps\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< steps, \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<evaluations\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< evaluations, largest local_error/budget_step \>\"", ",", 
        "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<analysis\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<largestRatio\>\""}], 
            "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\<, largest deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ScientificForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"devTwo", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\< <= budget_out \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ScientificForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"boutTwo", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", "\"\<, Hermite polynomials within \>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ScientificForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"runTwo", "[", "\"\<hermiteAt\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ",
           "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[318]:=",ExpressionUUID->"cfc96568-c663-4c5e-ae5a-34ce579c2c8d"],

