                  "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], " ", 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[CapitalPsi]\"", 
                   TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "3"}, "RowDefault"], "\"*\""}, 
                  "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], "-", 
               RowBox[{
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[CapitalPi]\"", "\"LL\"", "3"}, 
                  "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], " ", 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[CapitalPsi]\"", 
                   TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "4"}, "RowDefault"], "\"*\""}, 
                  "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}], 
             ")"}]}], "-", 
         RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                 SubscriptBox["\"\[CapitalPsi]\"", 
                  TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "3"}, "RowDefault"]], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"-", 
                    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[Omega]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "1"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], "-", 
                    FractionBox[
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[Omega]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "2"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "2"], 
                    "-", 
                    FractionBox[
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[CurlyPi]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "1"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "2"], 
                    "+", 
                    RowBox[{
                    FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[CurlyPi]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "2"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}], 
                   ")"}]}], "+", 
               RowBox[{
                 SubscriptBox["\"\[CapitalPsi]\"", 
                  TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "1"}, "RowDefault"]], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"-", 
                    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[Omega]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "3"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], "-", 
                    FractionBox[
                    TemplateBox[{"\"\[CurlyPi]\"", 
                    TemplateBox[{"\"LL,\"", "\"0\""}, "RowDefault"], "3"}, 
                    "Subsuperscript", SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], 
                    "2"]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]},
      "RowDefault"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{
       SubscriptBox["M", "LL"], "\"(\"", 
       SubscriptBox[
        TagBox[
         StyleBox["D", FontWeight -> "Bold", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
         "SL31Bold"], "LL"], "\") = \"", 
       TagBox[
        RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", 
          GridBox[{{
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "0", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "+", 
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "3", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], 
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "1", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "-", 
               RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "2", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}]}, {
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "1", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "+", 
               RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "2", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}], 
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "0", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "-", 
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "3", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
           ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
           Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
        Function[BoxForm`e$, 
         MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], "\",   \"", 
       SubscriptBox["M", "LL"], "\"(\"", 
       OverscriptBox[
        SubscriptBox[
         TagBox[
          StyleBox["D", FontWeight -> "Bold", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          "SL31Bold"], "LL"], "_"], "\") = \"", 
       TagBox[
        RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", 
          GridBox[{{
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "0", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "-", 
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "3", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "1", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], "+", 
               RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "2", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}]}, {
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "1", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}], "-", 
               RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                 
                 TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "2", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                  SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}], 
             RowBox[{
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "0", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox], "+", 
               
               TemplateBox[{"\"\[Del]\"", "3", "\"LL\""}, "Subsuperscript", 
                SyntaxForm -> SubsuperscriptBox]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
           ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
           Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
        Function[BoxForm`e$, 
         MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]},
      "RowDefault"]}
   },
   DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{1}}}],
  "Column"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004014804944886*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[517]=",ExpressionUUID->"cdc40a21-507a-4614-b87d-53a194b97b6c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<GS-12\>\"", ",", 
   " ", "\"\<the printed formulas agree with the matrices that they describe: \
the entries of Ppair (symbolic d), of the blocks of sgen(u_p) and of Gamma_p, \
the expansions of the covariant derivatives, the sixteen equations of the \
Dirac-Bogoliubov-de Gennes system, the pair operators Pi and the eight exact \
equations, each evaluated for numbers assigned to its symbols and compared \
with the matrix computation (tolerance 1e-12)\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"pdev", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-12"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
    RowBox[{"eqdev", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-12"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
    RowBox[{"eqdev2", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-12"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
    RowBox[{"pidev", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-12"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
    RowBox[{"eqdev3", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-12"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<largest deviations \>\"", ",", " ", "pdev", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<, \>\"", ",", " ", "eqdev", ",", " ", "\"\<, \>\"", ",", " ", 
      "eqdev2", ",", " ", "\"\<, \>\"", ",", " ", "pidev", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<, \>\"", ",", " ", "eqdev3", ",", 
      " ", "\"\< (original: 0.0e0, 4.0e-16, 3.4e-16, 0.0e0, 5.0e-16)\>\""}], 
     "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[518]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a8425932-6a3d-4938-82aa-be39dbabb92c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\<\"PASS  \"\>",
    StripOnInput->False,
    LineColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0],
    FrontFaceColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0],
    BackFaceColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0],
    GraphicsColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0],
    FontWeight->Bold,
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0]], "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"GS-12\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\": \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"the printed formulas agree with the matrices \
that they describe: the entries of Ppair (symbolic d), of the blocks of \
sgen(u_p) and of Gamma_p, the expansions of the covariant derivatives, the \
sixteen equations of the Dirac-Bogoliubov-de Gennes system, the pair \
operators Pi and the eight exact equations, each evaluated for numbers \
assigned to its symbols and compared with the matrix computation (tolerance \
1e-12)\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   TemplateBox[{"\"  -- \"", 
     TemplateBox[{
      "\"largest deviations \"", "0.`", "\", \"", "3.554447978966673`*^-16", 
       "\", \"", "1.5700924586837752`*^-16", "\", \"", 
       "1.1102230246251565`*^-16", "\", \"", "2.2887833992611187`*^-16", 
       "\" (original: 0.0e0, 4.0e-16, 3.4e-16, 0.0e0, 5.0e-16)\""}, 
      "RowDefault"]},
    "RowDefault"]}],
  SequenceForm[
   Style["PASS  ", Bold, 
    RGBColor[0, 
     Rational[2, 3], 0]], "GS-12", ": ", 
   "the printed formulas agree with the matrices that they describe: the \
entries of Ppair (symbolic d), of the blocks of sgen(u_p) and of Gamma_p, the \
expansions of the covariant derivatives, the sixteen equations of the \
Dirac-Bogoliubov-de Gennes system, the pair operators Pi and the eight exact \
equations, each evaluated for numbers assigned to its symbols and compared \
with the matrix computation (tolerance 1e-12)", 
   Row[{"  -- ", 
     Row[{
      "largest deviations ", 0., ", ", 3.554447978966673*^-16, ", ", 
       1.5700924586837752`*^-16, ", ", 1.1102230246251565`*^-16, ", ", 
       2.2887833992611187`*^-16, 
       " (original: 0.0e0, 4.0e-16, 3.4e-16, 0.0e0, 5.0e-16)"}]}]],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0040148049517603`*^9},
 CellLabel->
