Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
GS-13: the time integration by IDA, compared with the exact solution\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c0cedcd9-c032-40b7-ae9f-ecd3a6d12966"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The original program checks its time integration on the lattice of GS-10 \
(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"3", "\[Times]", "2", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b0b05513-1c89-4ded-bd36-1e3e68203f40"],
 " sites with random links, potentials and pair fields; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["cpx",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "384"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60a0e185-c6d8-4b33-b734-e6ad6d4b8fa2"],
 "). From a random initial state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["lat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2925ab8a-fe79-4763-94de-b732f6793a02"],
 " of the norm 1, drawn from a generator of its own (seed 2026111713, so that \
the random numbers of the later checks are not shifted), it integrates the \
lattice equations with CVODE up to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], "\[LongEqual]", "20"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7ac81100-c802-44a4-b6f4-1eb509d4a2c0"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "8"}]], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f212ee7-15f8-4785-87e1-1dc46b694bc5"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "100"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "544a40c5-265e-4d89-9e1d-d43888b68355"],
 ", and compares the states at the 41 output times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], "\[LongEqual]", "0", ",", "0.5", ",", 
    "\[Ellipsis]", ",", "20"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ad5e86a1-25b2-480f-8c65-46b679be9a97"],
 " with the exact solution ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["ex",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0195f559-7c36-48db-bba2-05c161bb69eb"],
 ": the sum over the eigenvectors of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["lat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f17ff1ac-d55f-4dcc-b9c5-d298c7ca939c"],
 " of the eigenvector times its scalar product with the initial state times \
the phase factor of the angle ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
       StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
      StyleBox["qp",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6bb8e234-5bf4-49ef-86c9-55c6d2f0eb1a"],
 " (eigensolver ",
 StyleBox["t2eigh",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "). The quantity compared is the relative deviation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "eca6f899-50ea-464a-8a6e-0361b6048599"],
 ", the norm of the difference between the computed and the exact state \
divided by the norm of the exact state. The notebook repeats the check with \
IDA in place of CVODE (functions ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["t2localErrorsIDA",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of chapter II.1.5): the same lattice, the same initial state, the same \
tolerances, the same output times."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aca42f32-b871-4e0c-baef-066a7bbe0aff"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The check has four parts, for each of the three tolerances. (1) The exact \
local error ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9b21df1b-4476-48e0-976a-b7145f1de4ee"],
 " of every internal step is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["loc",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e4cdb7ea-0fa0-4a61-9622-b3114352de78"],
 " times the norm of the state plus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{"2", 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["cpx",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "61e1fa38-e7b7-4790-8232-2117e9bf5bce"],
 ". Because the evolution is unitary, the deviation at the end of every \
internal step is then at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["err",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["st",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["loc",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4cacbcda-2af5-440a-a6c1-c26a8f47ba55"],
 " (chapter II.1.5). (2) The states of ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " at the output times are the cubic Hermite polynomials of the stored values \
and derivatives (tolerance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "12"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a42e7a18-9153-4563-8254-7d9d1bea530a"],
 "), so that the bound ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["out",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b2950797-173c-4d2b-926f-459c6c07b663"],
 " of chapter II.1.5 holds for them, and the largest ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65f08505-096d-473b-a2b9-f55da4afd0ab"],
 " is at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["out",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0257425e-7dae-429e-80bb-63c70a10a004"],
 " (the exact state has the norm 1, so the relative deviation is the \
deviation). (3) The largest deviation decreases from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "8"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b2f820e5-f607-448d-992a-632f47ec872c"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9aebdfae-c8bd-487c-aa9b-1e9e851954f0"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "12"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1509b836-0e7b-48ca-9770-73d979d79214"],
 ". (4) The two requirements of the original check for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ceb7ac8b-ce5f-4186-906c-d5628b1053db"],
 ": the largest deviation stays below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "9"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "857730ef-616d-4080-b50f-56b7e52b04bb"],
 ", and the norm of the state, which the exact evolution conserves, changes \
by less than ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2fd1a6f3-951c-44c0-b714-2b19991f9ae8"],
 ". The printed line also gives the numbers of internal steps ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["st",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c9bd1c9-7d67-4946-9919-8c64d432370a"],
 " and of evaluations ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["ev",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c4aa41c4-e44d-477c-b7a9-7ac455ab4011"],
 " of the right side, the largest internal steps, and the results of CVODE \
from the report of the original program."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1898892b-e01c-4606-9f83-c5920df105e3"],

