5.9e-11, steps 1528, 3661, 3804)\""}, "RowDefault"]},
    "RowDefault"]}],
  SequenceForm[
   Style["PASS  ", Bold, 
    RGBColor[0, 
     Rational[2, 3], 0]], "GS-13", ": ", 
   "time integration: the lattice equations (i times the derivative of the \
Nambu mode w_lat with respect to the time x_LL^0 equals H_lat w_lat) are \
integrated by IDA (SUNDIALS, through NDSolve with Method -> \"IDA\": backward \
differentiation formulas of the orders 1 to 5 with local error control and \
Newton's method; the tolerance of every real unknown is rtol times its \
modulus plus atol) in place of CVODE of the original program; on the 3 x 2 x \
4 lattice of GS-10 (384 complex components), from the random initial state of \
the norm 1 of the original program, for each of rtol = 1e-8, 1e-10, 1e-12 \
(atol = rtol/100): (1) the exact local error local_error of every internal \
step is at most budget_step = rtol (norm of the state) + atol sqrt(768); (2) \
the states at the 41 output times x_LL^0 = 0, 0.5, ..., 20 are the cubic \
Hermite polynomials of the stored values and derivatives (tolerance 1e-12), \
and their largest relative deviation from the exact spectral solution w_exact \
is at most budget_out = (1 + h_IDA E_max/4) budget + h_IDA deriv_residual/4 + \
(h_IDA E_max)^4/384 with budget = N_steps budget_step; (3) the largest \
deviation decreases from rtol = 1e-8 to 1e-10 to 1e-12; (4) for rtol = 1e-12 \
it stays below 1e-9, and the norm of the state changes by less than 1e-10", 
   Row[{"  -- ", 
     Row[{"for rtol = 1e-8, 1e-10, 1e-12: largest local_error/budget_step ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[0.8291341416836785, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[0.3238809320065986, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[0.3195915622060343, 2]}], 
       "; largest relative deviations ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[7.125333219739698*^-6, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[9.308767142501674*^-8, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[4.378788443188416*^-11, 2]}], " <= budget_out ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[0.00003513393220651155, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[9.411359201820919*^-7, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[5.2570221944433115`*^-8, 2]}], " (budget ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[0.000034546315895158106`, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[9.33452949640335*^-7, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[5.250401452006498*^-8, 2]}], 
       "); largest norm changes ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[4.0991317411531725`*^-6, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[5.365863164907836*^-8, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[9.723999383481896*^-12, 2]}], "; N_steps ", 
       Row[{2705, 7309, 41111}, ", "], "; N_evals ", 
       Row[{11182, 18096, 54585}, ", "], "; largest h_IDA ", 
       Row[{
         ScientificForm[0.007489190703255488, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[0.0032000000000000015`, 2], ", ", 
         ScientificForm[0.0005832000000000003, 2]}], 
       "; largest deriv_residual ", 
