Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The data files of the original program", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"7113fa0a-51a4-482f-aa3c-526d6dd37487"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The original program t2_fields wrote the numbers of its two figures into \
three data files: t2_dispersion_lattice.csv (the 48 points of Figure 1: for \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["W",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5facb066-271d-4cf2-9fc1-32a714eedb3c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["W",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cf95637c-7a61-4085-8046-e623f2a2358e"],
 " and each of the 24 momenta, the largest eigenvalue of the lattice \
operator), t2_dispersion_curves.csv (the 802 points of the curves of Figure \
1: for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["W",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a02cf748-a5e7-4fef-8789-33379a8d4799"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["W",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e9ae2e97-5970-45ae-bc6f-01b14dab6d8e"],
 " and each of 401 momenta, the continuum energy ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7861b7bd-86a5-4ce1-a4f0-cef56cff8d38"],
 " and the formula of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["lat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "314ee0c9-04cf-4a89-b3b9-92688a0c97e1"],
 ") and t2_cvode_accuracy.csv (the 41 rows of its integrations of GS-13 by \
CVODE: the output time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dd2e5d00-0fe9-4889-b4c8-3e114099d53d"],
 "; the relative deviations ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd3235bc-d5f4-46aa-9549-3bfd467d8442"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "8"}]], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "97fdc02b-1908-4a17-8a41-c8a89c3df372"],
 "; and, for the same three tolerances, the length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["CV",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9496cf6a-d47e-4b78-992f-28d124344aab"],
 " and the order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["CV",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dc357f19-04bc-4d12-b064-5c360a4da9bb"],
 " of the last internal step of CVODE before the output time, 0 in the first \
row). The first two files print their numbers with 10 decimals, the third \
with 7 significant digits (its times with 4 decimals). The next cell contains \
every number of the three files, copied without change, so that the notebook \
stays complete. The check after it compares the numbers of Figure 1 with the \
lists ",
 StyleBox["points",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["curves",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " computed above, row by row and column by column; because the files are \
rounded, deviations up to half a unit of the last printed decimal, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "11"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "77d239b6-af1e-4cce-bd35-d31cb4d79570"],
 ", are expected, and larger deviations would mean that the rewritten \
programs compute different numbers. The integrations by CVODE cannot be \
repeated in the Wolfram Language; for them the check confirms that the file \
has the output times of GS-13 and that its numbers show what the original \
check GS-13 states: the deviations are rounding errors in the first row, stay \
below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "9"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f02e79e-024f-4f52-a8cb-829add0f20bb"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b82556ae-2f67-49f4-b6cf-7d8b73146905"],
 ", and their largest values decrease from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "8"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb6e34d6-a904-4316-8c3a-9aefb6c85a54"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e521a320-f107-4138-ac8d-eb2858d5c284"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "12"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d64d8774-b636-4fff-af25-7a13b81cb005"],
 ". Figure 2 shows them together with the deviations of IDA computed in GS-13."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f8b46ac8-c48d-444a-a0ab-927d6aa46f28"],

